; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">예약취소는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">회까지 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">통학버스는 매일 등교</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">하교를 각</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">회씩 이용할 수 있으므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">예약후 탑승하지 못하는 경우는 필히 예약을 취소하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">취소를 하지 않으면</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">버스를 이용한 것으로 처리됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">또한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">빈 좌석으로 운행되어 필요한 학생도 이용하지 못하게 됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">환불신청은 원스톱서비스에서 신청하기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주일 단위로 모아서 환불 처리 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">환불시는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">7,000</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원씩 계산하여 지난 일수만큼 공제하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청당일은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3,500</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원을 공제후 환불합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. (</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">정기권은 정상적으로 계산한 요금의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">80%</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이하 이므로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">60</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 이상 경과시 환불금액이 없습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">버스기사의 잦은 이직으로 출발시간 및 승하차지점을 혼동하는 기사가 있을 경우는</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">출발시간 및 승하차지점을 알려줘서 같이 이용할 수 있도록 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">음주후 승차로 타 이용자에게 불편을 주지 말 것을 당부드리며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">안전운행을 위하여 안전벨트를 매기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">통학버스 요금은 후원금이 아닌 이용요금으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">연말정산 대상이 아닙니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기타 문의사항은 학생처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(478-7044)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">로 연락바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
